abstract: "An experimental saved-MCP-descriptor review utility with a released-version case study, supplemental reapproval vocabulary and separate all-synthetic regression corpus. Structural changes remain visible alongside incomplete policy findings. The case study reports local observations, not detection accuracy or reviewer benefit; external usefulness is not established."
